AB  - The IT industry and academic researchers pay more attention to the world. The cloud provider offers dynamic scalability services as needed. Therefore cloud computing environment the ranking of services between cloud provider/service provider offers different services to users. So for the user's perspective, it is difficult to select the best service provider that fulfills their expectations of service. Therefore ranking prioritizes services for selection of effective cloud service providers is needed. The paper proposes service selection for cloud computing in multi-criteria decision-making situations based on fuzzy logic techniques. The proposed model is based on fuzzy logic techniques for selection of cloud providers to user their need preference attributes as security, storage, and financial for selecting the providers. The ranking of cloud is based on priorities of attributes set by the provider. The model produces the set of ranks to the cloud provider to select the best cloud services.  © 2020 IEEE.
