TI  - Energy-Aware Opportunistic Charging and Energy Distribution for Sustainable Vehicular Edge and Fog Networks
PY  - 2020
T2  - 2020 5th International Conference on Fog and Mobile Edge Computing, FMEC 2020
C7  - 9144973
