TI  - Deploying Big Data Enablers to Strengthen Supply Chain Resilience to Mitigate Sustainable Risks Based on Integrated HOQ-MCDM Framework
PY  - 2022
T2  - Mathematics
VL  - 10
IS  - 8
C7  - 1233
