AB  - This article is devoted to a software selection problem. Usually, this problem is considered as a multicriteria decision making (MCDM) problem. One of the important problems in MCDM is criteria interaction. An effective approach to solving this problem is the use of fuzzy measure, particularly Sugeno λ-measure. In this paper, we use Choquet integral w.r.t. Sugeno λ-measure in software selection problem with four criteria and 5 alternatives. The comparative analysis of additive and non-additive measures are provided. © 2022, The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG.
