AB  - The proceedings contain 40 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Application of Big Data, Blockchain, and Internet of Things for Education Informatization. The topics include: Research on Practical Teaching Design of Applied College Mental Health Course in Virtual Simulation Scene; the Development Trend of Intelligent Law in Colleges and Universities Based on Intelligent Data Collection and Analysis; research on Big Data of Vocational Education Based on Simhash Algorithm; the Application of Big Data Analysis Methods in Classical Catalog Studies; the Use of Big Data Platform Plays in Building a New Model of English Teaching in Universities; application of Decision Tree Algorithm in the Analysis and Evaluation of Quality Education Credits; research on the Design of College Student Education Management System in the Era of Big Data; design and Implementation of College Student Volunteer Service Platform Based on Collaborative Filtering Algorithm; research on the Design of Ideological and Political Module in the Internet-Based Higher Mathematics Learning Platform; design and Implementation of University Management Information System Based on Decision Tree Algorithm; the Specific Construction Path of Vocational Education Group Based on Big Datag; Design of University Public Curriculum Education System Platform Based on AHP Algorithm; motivational Design Framework of Online French Interpretation Teaching Model Based on Intelligent Big Data; the Evaluation of English Teaching Mode in the Context of Big Data; Modeling and Analysis of the Influence of College Students’ Cultural Confidence Based on KPCA Algorithm; design of Decision Tree Algorithm in University Teaching Management Platform; preface.
